{"about_the_game":"<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>For demo version</strong>, you can only complete the first level of challenges, and the entire process takes approximately 15 to 30 minutes.</u></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>More than 10 Different Pinballs</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dragging two identical pinballs together allows you to synthesize a higher-level pinball.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> Rich and Diverse Monster Types</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different monsters with unique skill effects are continuously unlocked based on the difficulty of the levels.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> Flexible Level Selection</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After completing each level, you can choose a higher-level stage to earn a higher score.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> Equipment Selection and Random Equipment</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can select one piece of equipment when upgrading; both the equipment's quality and stats are random.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> Skill Selection and Random Skills</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can choose one skill when upgrading, with a maximum of 12 skills selectable in total. The skill's cost and CD are somewhat random.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> Data Statistics and Analysis</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each floor individually counts the data of each type of pinball, making it easier to make better choices.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> Achievement System and Rewards</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After unlocking achievements, you can obtain different initial bonuses.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4070040?t=1760038899","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4070040?t=1760038899","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4070040/510f6f79d27472a8c84c5870a41940c5dc4e04c7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760038899","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4070040/510f6f79d27472a8c84c5870a41940c5dc4e04c7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760038899","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>For demo version</strong>, you can only complete the first level of challenges, and the entire process takes approximately 15 to 30 minutes.</u></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>More than 10 Different Pinballs</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dragging two identical pinballs together allows you to synthesize a higher-level pinball.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> Rich and Diverse Monster Types</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different monsters with unique skill effects are continuously unlocked based on the difficulty of the levels.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> Flexible Level Selection</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After completing each level, you can choose a higher-level stage to earn a higher score.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> Equipment Selection and Random Equipment</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can select one piece of equipment when upgrading; both the equipment's quality and stats are random.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> Skill Selection and Random Skills</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can choose one skill when upgrading, with a maximum of 12 skills selectable in total. The skill's cost and CD are somewhat random.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> Data Statistics and Analysis</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each floor individually counts the data of each type of pinball, making it easier to make better choices.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> Achievement System and Rewards</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After unlocking achievements, you can obtain different initial bonuses.</p>","developers":["COSO"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3779500","name":"Pinball Hero"},"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4070040/6d2f8f25790f81ac5381b85662569d933e229afd/header.jpg?t=1760038899","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4070040/1994988710/db1c30fd2263008f7189e7693bbecc267765cab0/1760009079/dash_av1.mpd?t=1760011033","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4070040/1994988710/db1c30fd2263008f7189e7693bbecc267765cab0/1760009079/dash_h264.mpd?t=1760011033","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4070040/1994988710/db1c30fd2263008f7189e7693bbecc267765cab0/1760009079/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1760011033","id":257214786,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257214786/movie480.mp4?t=1760011033","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257214786/movie_max.mp4?t=1760011033"},"name":"combat demonstration","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257214786/76130b0c7e503dc46c7d7cb8c13756c70ae3fd2f/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1760011033","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257214786/movie480.webm?t=1760011033","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257214786/movie_max.webm?t=1760011033"}},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4070040/2066110707/0cae7221568e0f2734d69537c79e769d36fb3624/1759084758/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759990701","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstat